    {
      "id": "2121443457898299773",
      "text": "Oliver Bjorkstrand nets one on #NYR power play to take a 2-1 lead with 11:39 left in the second. Captain J.T. Miller set it up as the boos rained down.",
      "url": "https://x.com/MollieeWalkerr/status/2121443457898299773",
      "published": "2026-11-14T03:21:49+00:00",
      "likes": 23,
      "author": "Mollie Walker",
      "handle": "MollieeWalkerr",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1796968697690566656/xMLIAVCf_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2121443447332639149",
      "text": "The second PP unit has consistently been the better of the two for #NYR. Miller just set up Bjorkstrand to make it 2-1 with 11:39 left in the second period.",
      "url": "https://x.com/vzmercogliano/status/2121443447332639149",
      "published": "2026-11-14T03:21:47+00:00",
      "likes": 42,
      "author": "Vince Z. Mercogliano",
      "handle": "vzmercogliano",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1688744117088464896/na0u3L5s_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2121443120969593342",
      "text": "Filip Chytil is killing penalties for Vancouver. Can't ever recall him doing that with #NYR.",
      "url": "https://x.com/vzmercogliano/status/2121443120969593342",
      "published": "2026-11-14T03:20:29+00:00",
      "likes": 26,
      "author": "Vince Z. Mercogliano",
      "handle": "vzmercogliano",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1688744117088464896/na0u3L5s_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "#NYR are 2-for-2 on the PK, and now they'll head to the power play for the first time.",
      "quoted_author": "Vince Z. Mercogliano",
      "quoted_handle": "vzmercogliano"
    },
    {
      "id": "2121442787539259751",
      "text": "#NYR are 2-for-2 on the PK, and now they'll head to the power play for the first time.",
