      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1688744117088464896/na0u3L5s_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "J.T. Miller is hearing boos from the Vancouver crowd when he's on puck. The Rangers captain won a board battle against Elias Pettersson, and the possession ended up in the back of the #Canucks net. Miller appeared to have words during the celebration for his former teammates.",
      "quoted_author": "Thomas Drance",
      "quoted_handle": "ThomasDrance"
    },
